    "$description": "SwiftUI springs (§5, §10.4): stiffness = (2π/d)², damping = 4π(1 − bounce)/d, mass 1. $value.duration is the CSS settle time (|x − 1| < 5 × 10⁻⁴ from then on) and $value.timingFunction a fitted cubic-bezier fallback for other DTCG tools; the generator writes a CSS linear() curve from the spring itself.",
    "calm": {
